# Route Folder Structure

Colocate route-private code under the route segment. Use `~/lib/` when **two or more route trees** import the same module.

```
{route-segment}/
  (page).tsx
  actions.ts
  hooks/
  components/
  utils/
```

- Do not define inline `action()` in route `.tsx` when a colocated `*.actions.ts` exists.
- App-wide UI stays in `~/components/ui/`.
